; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 33. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'btDC_plane_jumping'
btDC_plane_jumping.dialogstring_0981F4! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:0]Neil: Well, we're about to[N]arrive, Will.[FIN]I guess I should give my[N]regards to your dad.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]Will: Thank you. You've[N]become an outstanding[N]company president too,[N]haven't you, Neil?[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3][DLY:0]Erik: Aah. From here on, I[N]guess we won't be able to[N]meet with you for a while.[FIN]When you're finished with[N]what you have to do, come[N]back to South Cape right[N]away.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]Will: Thanks. I had fun[N]going on a journey with[N]all of you too.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3][DLY:0]Erik: Everyone found[N]something on this journey,[N]haven't they?[FIN]Lance encountered Lilly,[N]and met again with his[N]missing father.[FIN]Neil set his heart on[N]succeeding his parents'[N]company.[FIN]For the first time since[N]she was born, Kara saw[N]the world outside of the[N]castle and travelled it[N]with her own two feet.[FIN]I've done one thing, to[N]make use of this[N]opportunity, too.[FIN]It seems like I've become[N]able to go pee by myself[N]at night…![FIN][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:0]Neil: Hahaha.[N]Typical Erik.[FIN]By the way, I don't think[N]Kara has said anything[N]yet.[FIN]You won't be able to meet[N]with Will for a while.[N]It's almost a parting[N]statement.[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara:[DLY:4] Yeah. That's how it[N]is, isn't it…[FIN][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:4][DLY:1]Neil: Oops, as I've been[N]talking, we've come up to[N]the Tower of Babel right[N]here.[FIN]Alright, Will. Is your[N]parachute ready…?[N]Let's go…![END]`
btDC_plane_jumping.dialogstring_0984B1! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:2]And so, after a year and a[N]half, I'm going to be[N]standing in the Tower of[N]Babel once again…[PAU:94][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'btDE_monologue'
btDE_monologue.dialogstring_099914! `[DEF]The Tower of Babel stands[N]silent, as if the past[N]year and a half never[N]passed at all[AD][END]`
btDE_monologue.dialogstring_099952! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]If I recall, the flute[N]that I'm holding was[N]discovered here.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDF_crystal_ring'
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099A70! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]It seems that something[N]broke off from my flute…[END]`
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099A91! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]T-this is the Crystal Ring[N]that King Edward was[N]obsessed with![FIN]I had thought it was a[N]decoration on the flute,[N]but it was hidden here…[END]`
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099AE4! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][DLY:9]Got the Crystal Ring![PAU:78][END]`
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099AFE! `[CLR][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]But your inventory[N]is full![PAL:0][END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039F35! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]This is definitely the[N]Crystal Ring that King[N]Edward was searching for.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDF_kara'
btDF_kara.dialogstring_099F1B! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Wait…[END]`
btDF_kara.dialogstring_099F2A! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]Will: Kara!?[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Will: I'm sorry…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]When we had been separated[N]just now, I somehow had a[N]feeling that we wouldn't[N]meet again…[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]Will: But Kara, how did[N]you manage to come in[N]here?[FIN]You shouldn't have been[N]able to come without this[N]Crystal Ring…[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: I wonder, could it[N]be this ring that did it…?[FIN]See, we found it at the[N]Gold Ship of the Inca,[N]didn't we?[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]This Crystal Ring's colour[N]is dark blue…[FIN]The ring that Kara is[N]holding is light blue,[N]isn't it…[FIN]I guess that maybe this is[N]what you call light and[N]darkness.[FIN]Will: I understand… I[N]don't know what will[N]happen, but don't leave my[N]side.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDF_spirits'
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099B8F! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: The comet's light[N]holds great power over the[N]growth of living things.[WAI][N]As the star draws near,[N]that influence grows ever[N]stronger.[WAI][N]Change that would require[N]ages may then occur in a[N]single lifetime.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099C95! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Life hath changed[N]through countless ages.[WAI][N]Creatures of the sea gave[N]way to new forms upon the[N]land, and in time humanity[N]arose.[WAI][N]Change itself is natural.[N]The comet did not create[N]that truth.[WAI][N]It hasteneth change, and[N]would direct its course.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099D16! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Thou hast heard the[N]comet called both blessing[N]and curse.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Both names contain truth.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Its power can free life[N]from sickness, age, and[N]mortal flesh.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]But a gift imposed is no[N]gift at all.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Thy task is not to halt[N]change, Will.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]It is to ensure that[N]life's path remains its[N]own to choose.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099C1E! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Time runneth swiftly[N]within the Tower of Babel.[WAI][N]Years may pass here while[N]the world beyond knoweth[N]only moments.[WAI][N]Yet thou and Kara endure.[N]Both of you bear powers[N]older than this tower.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099DE5! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Beings reshaped by[N]the comet's light sleep[N]within the next chamber.[WAI][N]They bar the path above.[N]If thou wouldst ascend,[N]lay them to rest.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDE_kara_missing'
btDE_kara_missing.dialogstring_0986E1! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Oh, Kara isn't here[AD][N]Where did she go[AD]?)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE2_brought_back'
btE2_brought_back.dialogstring_099866! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Thou hast returned[N]to the place where thy[N]path first crossed the[N]comet's.[WAI][N]I shall bear thee to the[N]floor above.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE1_comet_soon'
btE1_comet_soon.dialogstring_09974E! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: The comet draweth[N]near to Earth.[WAI][N]There is little time left.[N]Ascend now to the peak of[N]the Tower of Babel.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE3_kara'
btE3_kara.dialogstring_098577! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Kara[AD]![N]Where did you go!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: The vampire woman[N]found me. She only wanted[N]to talk. She can't die[N]while the comet endures.[WAI][N]She thought living forever[N]was a gift. Now she can't[N]escape it.[WAI][N]She believes she can rest[N]at last if the comet's[N]hold is broken.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE3_dao_travel_spirit'
btE3_dao_travel_spirit.dialogstring_098053! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: If thou advancest[N]beyond this point, thou[N]canst not return.[FIN]I can bear thee back to[N]Dao if thou desirest.[FIN]What wilt thou do?[WAI][N][PAL:0] Continue[N] Return to Dao`
btE3_dao_travel_spirit.dialogstring_0980C1! `[CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E853! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: The comet draweth[N]near. Our final parting is[N]at hand.[WAI][N]Thou hast awakened the[N]Darkness carried through[N]thy bloodline.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Yet thou art no mere heir[N]to the Dark Knights.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The comet's light also[N]dwelleth within thee, from[N]the day thou first entered[N]this tower.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Kara descendeth from those[N]once called the Protectors[N]of Light.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Yet my voice hath reached[N]her in dreams.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The old lines have[N]crossed. Neither of you[N]standeth wholly where thy[N]ancestors stood.[WAI][N]If heir of Darkness and[N]heir of Light join by[N]choice, not command, the[N]Firebird may awaken.[WAI][N]Fight not because I[N]command thee, nor because[N]thy ancestors once chose[N]Darkness.[WAI][N]Fight so that life may[N]yet possess a future no[N]ancient power hath already[N]chosen.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The choice is thine.[FIN]`
